<Layout title="Privacy | Home is Cookie" description="How this Home is Cookie prototype handles order links, email signup, and information you choose to share."><article class="wrap prose"><p class="eyebrow">PROTOTYPE POLICY DRAFT</p><h1>Privacy.</h1><p class="notice">This draft describes the prototype. Final business retention practices and provider configurations need confirmation before launch.</p><h2>Information you choose to share</h2><p>Order requests open in Jotform. The request may include your contact details, requested products, delivery information, and artwork. Provide only information needed for your order. Payment processing is intended to use Square after approval; this prototype does not collect card information.</p><h2>Email updates</h2><p>The email signup link opens the existing Kit page. Joining the mailing list is optional and separate from placing an order. Unsubscribe using the link in marketing emails.</p><h2>This website</h2><p>The prototype’s order planner creates a summary in your browser. It does not submit that summary, save it to a customer account, or automatically transfer it to Jotform. Copying uses your device’s clipboard after you select the copy button. No advertising or analytics tags have been added to this prototype. Hosting and external providers may process technical access information under their own policies.</p><h2>Photos and artwork</h2><p>Permission to use submitted artwork for an order is separate from permission to display it publicly. Customer photographs and testimonials will be published only after review and appropriate permission.</p><h2>Questions</h2><p>Contact <a href="mailto:homeiscookie@gmail.com">homeiscookie@gmail.com</a> about the information you share. Final retention periods, deletion procedures, and provider disclosures will be confirmed before launch.</p></article></Layout>
